      "source_number": "120",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "I don't know. Some guy. He came from the east, he said. Like anyone could get past the deadlands to the east. He ran afoul of Gizmo, trying to interfere with Gizmo's business.",
      "source_text": "I don't know. Some guy. He came from the east, he said.\n Like anyone could get past the deadlands to the east.\n He ran afoul of Gizmo, trying to interfere with Gizmo's\n business.",
